  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1: Fixes a multi-page DirectContent bug where the first two logical pages could be rendered into the same physical page's content stream, producing visible overdraw and a physical page count one short of the caller's intent. Callers who wrote to PdfWriter.DirectContent before calling Document.NewPage() — the canonical multi-page export loop — are affected. Single-page callers and callers who call NewPage() before each page are unaffected. No API changes. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
